{"id":"5146","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5146_main_altocumulus-of-a-chaotic-sky_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>混沌天空中的高积云具有混乱、沉重和停滞的外观。它通常表现出从低层云到高层云的多样化。</p>\n<p>在这张照片中有四层云，都代表中间层。最高的云层是一层蔽光高层云，从西向西北方向消除。朝向图像中心的上面部分可以看到这一层的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">幡状云</span>。在高层云正下方的是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波状高积云</span>斑块。例如，在图片的左下方可以看到第三层是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">荚状高积云</span>。最下层是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状高积云</span>，主要在图片中心和右侧可见。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Martin Gudd","location":"德国富尔达","latitude":"纬度: 50° 33' 47'' N","longitude":"经度: 9° 40' 49'' E","date":"22 July 1985 2100 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 9, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.30","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.30"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5146_syn_altocumulus-of-a-chaotic-sky_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>概要图表显示的是拍摄照片前约七小时的情况。前热带风暴“安娜”（位于不列颠群岛上方）的推进暖锋位于德国富尔达的西边。截至拍摄照片时，暖锋位于德国中部和西北部。连续的降雨正从这片广阔的锋面云层中降下。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Verein Berliner Wetterkarte e.V.","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5146_sat_altocumulus-of-a-chaotic-sky_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>图为照片拍摄前一小时左右的情况。前热带风暴“安娜”位于北海上空。“安娜”的暖锋刚刚经过德国的中部地区，通道上在这个暖锋和冷锋之间隐约可见暖区。这张照片是在接近暖区的边缘拍摄的。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 鸣谢NOAA","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4468_main_chaotic-sky-cumulus-fractus-altocumulus-floccus-cirrostratus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>天空存在多层云。低层的碎积云对角横跨天空 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span> <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">与 3</span> - <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span> 处。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span> 处有广阔的絮状高积云，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">6</span> 处变得浓厚，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">7</span> 处出现城堡状云的迹象。所有云层上方可见广阔的卷层云。前一天不列颠群岛与法国上空气压非常微弱，法国上方存在一个不明确的锋面系统。当日低压移动至苏格兰西部，其暖锋位于爱尔兰东部，导致英格兰南部出现不稳定的南向气流。</p></div>","copyright":"© R.K. Pilsbury","location":"Bracknell, Berkshire, United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland","latitude":"纬度: 51° 24' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 45' 14'' W","date":"24 June 1971 2115 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 1, CM= 9, CH= 8","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}